# check_out_the_church — "Check Out the Church" (Quest 3)
#
# Granted by Daniel Pauls at the END of "Find the Magic Man" (daniel_pauls_quest_one), on the same
# choice that completes it — quests/dialogue/danielpauls.quest, node dpq1_speed. Completed by Daniel
# when the player brings him the makeshift vape; that same choice grants Quest 4
# (investigate_weird_vape).
#
# ⚠ NEW ITEM ID — makeshift_vape. The owner is still building this item. Its ItemData.ItemID must
# equal "makeshift_vape" exactly, or both the COLLECT stage below and Daniel's dialogue hand-in will
# fail to resolve on import. The vape is NOT consumed at Daniel — the player carries it on to Scrap
# Man in Quest 4.
#
# Daniel's lines for this quest live in quests/dialogue/danielpauls.quest, gated on this quest id.

QUEST check_out_the_church
TITLE: Check Out the Church
GIVER: Daniel Pauls
LOCATION: The abandoned church, by the castle.

# Collect is the last (and only) stage: a Collect stage never completes the quest itself — the
# hand-in is Daniel's dialogue, which carries the COMPLETE:. The makeshift vape drops from a Neek in
# the church; how it drops is content/loot placement, not the quest's concern.
STAGE COLLECT makeshift_vape x1
OBJECTIVE: Bring D.P. back something from the church to shed some light on the theft.
WHENMET: Take the makeshift vape to Daniel Paul's.

REWARD
POUNDS: 30
XP: 60
